'''Weapons'''
* [[gww:Vampric|Vampiric]] Hammer [[gww:Of_Fortitude|of Fortitude]], with "''[[gww:Inscription#Combat enhancing|Guided by Fate]]''"

== Usage ==
<pvxbig>
* Maintain {{skill pvxicon|Critical Agility}} and {{skill pvxicon|Critical Eye|16}}
* Build up adrenaline for your [[gww:Knock down|Knock Down]] skill
** Always try to hit as many foes as you can with {{skill pvxicon|Crude Swing|12}}, to quickly build adrenaline and to deal as much damage as you can
* Use the prefered [[gww:Knock down|Knock Down]], followed by 2x{{skill pvxicon|Renewing Smash|12}}. Target a foe with high hp, to make the most out of your [[gww:Knock down|Knock Down]]
* Use the rest of your skills as prefered.  
</pvxbig>

== Counters ==
<pvxbig>
* Enchantment removal
* Heavy melee hate
* Failing to hit with {{skill pvxicon|Renewing Smash|12}}, or not hitting a target with [[gww:Knock down|Knock Down]]
</pvxbig>